rows[#rows+1]={"What a pleasure, $c.$b$bWe get so few visitors these days.","정말 기쁘네요 $c.$b$b요즘은 방문객이 거의 없습니다."}
rows[#rows+1]={"What a silly question! Clearly, $n, I've overestimated you.$b$bIt should be apparent to you that someone needs to stay focused on the big picture here. Being the only one remotely qualified, alas, that burden falls to me.$b$bIn truth, I envy you, $c. I would much rather be the one to enter Zul'Aman and cleanse it of those savages. You should consider yourself lucky....\010","바보 같은 질문이야 $n내가 당신을 과대평가했어$b$b여러분께 분명하게 보여야 합니다. 누군가가 큰 그림을 집중해야 한다는 겁니다.$b$b사실, 난 널 부러워한다 $c내가  ⁇ 알아만으로 들어가 야만족을 제거하는 사람이 되고 싶네\010"}
