rows[#rows+1]={"What's the deal, $c?$B$BWord on the docks is that you've been poking around my construction sites...","무슨 일이야? $c?$B$B항구에서 들은 소식은 당신이 내 건설 현장을 둘러보고 있다는 것입니다..."}
rows[#rows+1]={"What's the matter, $c?  Think you're too good to stand in line with the rest of us?","무슨 일이야? $c우리들처럼 순차적으로 서기엔 너무 잘 안 돼?"}
rows[#rows+1]={"What's this, $c? You know my name?$B$BDo you know, then, of my reputation?$B$BI am Flametusk of the Dragonmaw clan. I commanded legions, flew on dragonback, witnessed the sundering of Grim Batol...$B$BCurse the Twilight's Hammer, and curse their ogre lapdogs. Look at me now. All talk and cheap liquor.","이게 뭐야? $c 내 이름은 알아요?$B$B내 명성을 알고 있나요?$B$B난 드래곤마우 족의 플라메투스크이고, 군대를 지휘하고, 드래곤백을 타고,$B$B마마르와 그 오그레 랩드그들을 저주해줘"}
rows[#rows+1]={"What's this?!  $n and $g his : her; friends come to play?","이게 뭐야? $n와 $g 그의: 그녀의; 친구들이 놀러 오는가?"}
rows[#rows+1]={"What's wrong, $n? Afraid to fight? Come on, let's keep this arena moving!","무슨 일이야? $n싸움을 두려워하는 거?"}
rows[#rows+1]={"What... What did you just do, $N?! Brann! Braaaaannn!","뭐야... 대체 무슨 짓을 한 거야, $N?! 브란! 브라아아안!"}
rows[#rows+1]={"What... What did you just do, $n?! Brann! Braaaaannn!","헉... 방금 대체 무슨 짓을 한 거죠, $n 님?! 브란! 브라아아아안!"}
rows[#rows+1]={"What?  $n, you served me well, but...","음? $n, 날 위해 큰일을 해 주었지만..."}
rows[#rows+1]={"What?  I look like a $c to you?$B$BGet outta here, will ya?","내가 $c처럼 보이시죠?$B$B여기서 나가, 알았어?"}
rows[#rows+1]={"What?  Such a small, frail thing beckons me?  I shall add your bones to my throne, $r!!","뭐냐? 이런 하룻강아지 같은 놈이 감히 내게 덤비겠다고? 네 뼈를 모아 내 옥좌를 장식해주마!"}
rows[#rows+1]={"What? Do I see rescuers? Over here, $r! Help us!","구조관들이 보이시나요? $r도와줘!"}
